    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "498db995_dcdefbcb",
        "filename": "radio/1.1/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 178,
      "author": {
        "id": 1054648
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-29T18:12:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The doc said it should be the default apn for the bearer. Does this need to be part of the request?\nAlso, does bearer need to be specified here?",
      "parentUuid": "3abeac21_b97b7ff7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 178,
        "endChar": 90
      },
      "revId": "285644a6d7f111b626e4dd7d95e7fdbfaa505e5e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b95673d5_1c7bb399",
        "filename": "radio/1.1/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 178,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-31T18:00:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If there\u0027s no data call to that APN, then it\u0027s an error. Likewise, if the data call ends, then we should get an UNSOL indicating that this Keepalive has gone to INACTIVE.\n\nNiraj, is there a better way to specify the data call here than just passing down the APN?",
      "parentUuid": "3abeac21_b97b7ff7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 178,
        "endChar": 90
      },
      "revId": "285644a6d7f111b626e4dd7d95e7fdbfaa505e5e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7086e51a_82e25807",
        "filename": "radio/1.1/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 178,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-31T18:00:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, I\u0027d expect it to go on whatever bearer other traffic from this address/port goes on for the given PDN connection. I\u0027d expect that to be mapped automatically by the TFT (if any). But, if it goes on the default bearer for the APN we probably won\u0027t notice unless that causes the traffic to drop.",
      "parentUuid": "498db995_dcdefbcb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 178,
        "endChar": 90
      },
      "revId": "285644a6d7f111b626e4dd7d95e7fdbfaa505e5e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "97ce48c6_24fa85ef",
        "filename": "radio/1.1/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 178,
      "author": {
        "id": 1062130
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-31T18:14:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "how about using existing call id from telephony? ensures no race between this request and telephony\u0027s understanding of whether data call is up or not and on which bearer it should go on.",
      "parentUuid": "b95673d5_1c7bb399",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 178,
        "endChar": 90
      },
